<newsitem itemid="248769" id="root" date="1996-12-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Adonis yr share halves, div falls.</title>
<headline>Adonis yr share halves, div falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     26.0	  vs 52.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 9.0	   vs 16.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.60	  vs 1.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.40	  vs 2.83</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.48	  vs 0.99</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.51	  vs 0.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		  15.81	 vs 15.50</p>
<p>Div payable Feb 10</p>
<p>on register Jan 24</p>
<p>Full name: Adonis Knitwear Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they expected earnings in the new financial year to match those in 1996. They said trading conditions would remain difficult, but that order books for winter 1997 were of the same size as for the previous winter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
